      "note": "Fresh five-route execution and candidate-profile native probes passed, with independent restoration and final audits. Exact stock client and current runtime/configuration/model identities were observed. Council binding, final immutable pins, strict ready verification and publication remain separate gates. rtx3090-native: attempt 1 passed the seven documented blocks but failed the post-route stock OMP subagent proof because the model emitted malformed tool arguments; that window restored. Attempt 2 ran while the host system drive was full: checkpoint writes failed with the OS disk-full error (Windows error 112), and post-route compaction failed; an operator recovery restored the lane. Attempt 3 was the third execution on the same candidate, recorded in the driver's single corrected-attempt slot (attempt 2), in fresh workspaces with at least 60 GiB of system-drive free space enforced before census and acceptance. It passed every phase with no disk-full errors."
    },
