  "scope": "F4 RTX 5090 beta.7 and v0.8.0-qwen38-3090-beta.3, v0.8.0-qwen38-4090-beta.3 exact current component qualification with stock OMP 18.18.7. Candidate 2a735da0367214b35a325f61865fb47f0ce872c7 passed all five documented routes' 31/31 blocks and three stock-client platform checks; RTX 4090 passed on its initial window and RTX 3090 passed every campaign, public-install and independent restoration phase on its third execution without a waiver. On RTX 3090, attempt 1 failed its post-route stock OMP subagent proof on malformed task tool arguments and restored; attempt 2 ran while the host system drive was full (27 checkpoint writes failed with OS disk-full error 112, checkpoint saves were refused for capacity, admission waited behind an outstanding checkpoint save across 4 HTTP 503 timeouts before a 900 s compaction timeout, managed Stop refused 9 sessions, and empty-session Start/Stop recovery restored the canonical lane); the founder-authorized third execution in fresh workspaces with an enforced 60 GiB free-space floor (63.08 GiB free, recorded in accept-rtx4090-route.py's single --attempt 2 rerun slot) passed every phase (2 committed compactions in 747.00 s, zero HTTP 503 responses, 1,439.367 s window). Request-level HTTP 503 pressure-save deferral (https://github.com/alphastorm/ninfer/issues/89) reproduced in acceptance only under attempt-2 disk exhaustion and remains tracked as an engine residual.",
